#: theblue-email-forms.php
msgid "Place your theblue.email signup forms on your site with a block or a shortcode, and collect newsletter signups from Gravity Forms and Contact Form 7."
msgstr "Umieszczaj formularze zapisu theblue.email na swojej stronie za pomocą bloku lub shortcode i zbieraj zapisy do newslettera z Gravity Forms oraz Contact Form 7."

